{"seq":3,"slug":"systems","title":"个性化系统","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/ecommerce-personalization-engine/systems","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"realtime-feature-service","title":"实时特征服务","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/ecommerce-personalization-engine/systems/realtime-feature-service","wordCount":2045,"readingTime":9},{"seq":2,"slug":"ranking-reranking-pipeline","title":"排序与重排管线","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/ecommerce-personalization-engine/systems/ranking-reranking-pipeline","wordCount":2217,"readingTime":9},{"seq":3,"slug":"multi-touchpoint-personalization","title":"多触点个性化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/ecommerce-personalization-engine/systems/multi-touchpoint-personalization","wordCount":2168,"readingTime":9}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"个性化系统\">个性化系统</h1><h2 id=\"本章概览\">本章概览</h2><p>算法模型的效果最终由系统工程来承载。本章聚焦个性化引擎的三大系统层：实时特征服务（如何在毫秒级延迟内提供高质量特征）、排序与重排管线（如何将算法评分转化为最终展示序列）、多触点个性化（如何在首页、搜索、商品页等多个触点提供一致的个性化体验）。</p>\n<p>本章包含三篇文档：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"realtime-feature-service\">实时特征服务</a>：在线/近线/离线三层特征体系的架构设计</li>\n<li><a href=\"ranking-reranking-pipeline\">排序与重排管线</a>：多目标融合、多样性保障、规则干预的管线设计</li>\n<li><a href=\"multi-touchpoint-personalization\">多触点个性化</a>：跨场景个性化统一架构与一致性保障</li>\n</ul>\n"}